@startuml
title Time-strip imagery bounds rendering
' Traces: OMCT-C11-L2-01.05
participant "Time Strip View" as TimeStrip
participant "Imagery Time View" as Imagery
participant "Telemetry Gateway" as Telemetry
participant "Image Strip" as Strip

TimeStrip -> Imagery: loadOrBoundsChanged(bounds)
activate Imagery
Imagery -> Telemetry: requestImages(bounds)
activate Telemetry
Telemetry --> Imagery: images within bounds
deactivate Telemetry
Imagery -> Strip: removeImagesOutside(bounds)
activate Strip
Strip --> Imagery: outside images removed
deactivate Strip
loop each image within bounds
    Imagery -> Strip: renderThumbnail(image)
    activate Strip
    Strip --> Imagery: thumbnail rendered
    deactivate Strip
end
Imagery --> TimeStrip: strip images refreshed
deactivate Imagery
@enduml
